@startuml 11-state-signup-request
title State - Sign-up request
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Pending : applicant submits\n(request id + claim code issued)
Pending --> Approved : operator approves\n/ account created
Pending --> Rejected : operator denies\n/ reason recorded
Approved --> Claimed : applicant collects the API key\n(exactly once)
Claimed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*] : applicant may submit\na new request

Pending : one open request per email
Approved : key not collected yet
Claimed : the account's real API key issued,\nonly its hash stored
@enduml
